---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { name: 'About Jeremy Fritzhand', href: '/about/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Jeremy Fritzhand"
  description="Meet Jeremy Fritzhand—founder of Studio Bagru and Fritz MFG, Minerva Fellow, and advocate for traditional Indian hand block printing and ethical craft."
  image="/og/about.png"
  pageType="ProfilePage"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-vermilion uppercase">
      Author &amp; Craft Entrepreneur
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-ink">About Jeremy Fritzhand</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg mt-6 max-w-none">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m <strong>Jeremy Fritzhand</strong>&mdash;a social entrepreneur, textile educator,
        and startup ecosystem builder whose work with hand block printing began in 2010 when I
        traveled to <strong>Bagru, Rajasthan</strong> as a <strong>Minerva Fellow</strong> from
        Union College.
      </p>
      <p>
        What started with a fellowship grant and a one-way ticket turned into years of living and
        working directly beside master <em>Chhipa</em> printers, woodblock carvers, and natural
        dyers roughly 30 kilometers southwest of Jaipur. Stirring dye vats, watching teakwood blocks
        take shape under hand chisels, and seeing firsthand how multi-layered export supply chains
        squeezed village workshops reshaped how I think about craft and commerce.
      </p>

      <h2>From Bagru Textiles to Studio Bagru &amp; Fritz MFG</h2>
      <p>
        To help artisans connect directly with global audiences, I launched early grassroots digital
        efforts (Bagru Textiles) and, in 2016, founded <strong>Studio Bagru</strong>&mdash;a
        transparent block-printing and cut-and-sew production studio bridging rural master artisans
        with independent international designers and brands including Story MFG, LRNCE, and Molly
        Mahon Textiles.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside production, our network pioneered <strong>Mahila Print</strong> to address
        cultural property and creative equity head-on: ensuring women artisans and block printers
        receive direct recognition and financial compensation for their <em>design rights</em>, not
        just per-meter printing labor. As local printing families grew fully self-sufficient in
        managing their own international clients, Studio Bagru evolved into an open directory and
        buyer&rsquo;s guide indexing authentic Bagru workshops directly.
      </p>
      <p>
        In 2023, I founded <strong>Fritz MFG</strong> to continue my work across global craft
        textiles, sustainable sourcing consultancy, and educational block-printing workshops,
        alongside my broader startup ecosystem leadership&mdash;including serving as CEO of
        VentureStudio at Ahmedabad University, Director of Startup Services at Alloy Growth Lab, and
        VP of Platform &amp; Member Engagement at Embarc Collective.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Blockprinting.org Exists</h2>
      <p>
        Too much writing about hand block printing reduces a 400-year-old living craft to vague
        marketing buzzwords. <strong>Blockprinting.org</strong> is my dedicated space to publish
        honest, technically accurate guides on woodblock carving, <em>dabu</em> mud-resist printing,
        natural dye chemistry, and ethical manufacturing&mdash;written from the perspective of
        someone who has spent years on the workshop floor.
      </p>

      <h2>Elsewhere Online</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://fritzhand.com" rel="me noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            fritzhand.com
          </a>{' '}
          &mdash; Personal site &amp; startup ecosystem work
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://fritzmfg.com" rel="me noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            fritzmfg.com
          </a>{' '}
          &mdash; Textile practice, workshops &amp; sustainable sourcing consultancy
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://studiobagru.com" rel="me noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            studiobagru.com
          </a>{' '}
          &mdash; Studio Bagru &amp; Bagru artisan directory
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/fritzhand" rel="me noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            github.com/fritzhand
          </a>{' '}
          &mdash; GitHub
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
